How to install:
---------------

You have to get sources as follows (login: <an email address> passwd: anoncvs):

cvs -z 9 -d :pserver:anoncvs@sources.redhat.com:/cvs/src login
cvs -z 9 -d :pserver:anoncvs@sources.redhat.com:/cvs/src export -D 20050226 binutils

Then rename exported directory:

mv src binutils

Then patch sources (you have to be in directory above binutils directory not inside it):

patch -p0 </path_to_patch/binutils_20050226_dsp56800_x.y.z/binutils.patch

Then compile according to binutils/README and enjoy :)
